-# BraveTv 📺🛡️
+# NeverMore 📺🛡️
 
-**BraveTv** is a privacy-first, ad-blocking Smart TV web app and streaming launcher designed for **Android TV**, **Google TV**, and Leanback-compatible devices.
+**NeverMore** is an open-source, ad-blocking web app launcher for **Android TV**, **Google TV** and Leanback-compatible devices. Open YouTube TV, Twitch and other streaming sites in a TV-friendly WebView, with ad and tracker blocking built in.
 
-Powered by Brave's native `adblock-rust` filtering engine, BraveTv allows you to stream content from your favorite web streaming services (such as YouTube TV, Hotstar, Twitch, etc.) on the big screen with high-performance ad-blocking and clean video playback.
+It uses the [`adblock-rust`](https://github.com/brave/adblock-rust) filtering engine (the same engine Brave's browser uses) together with EasyList, uBlock Origin and Brave filter lists.
+
+> **Personal use only.** Blocking ads on YouTube is against YouTube's Terms of Service. You use this software at your own risk. It is intended to be sideloaded for personal use, and it will not be accepted on Google Play. To support creators, consider YouTube Premium.
+>
+> NeverMore is an independent project. It is not affiliated with Brave Software, Google or YouTube.
 
 ---
 
 ## ✨ Features
 
-- 🛋️ **TV-First Experience**: Built for Android TV / Google TV with Leanback launcher banner and D-Pad remote navigation.
-- ⚡ **Native Brave Ad-Block Engine**: Uses compiled Rust JNI bindings (`adblock-rust`) with high-speed rule matching for EasyList, uBlock Origin, and Brave filter lists.
-- 🛡️ **Multi-Tier Ad Mitigation**:
-  1. **Network Layer**: Blocks third-party ad networks, telemetry, and tracking endpoints before requests leave the device.
-  2. **Smart Stream Allowlist**: Protects video CDN streams (`googlevideo.com`), essential player runtime scripts (`/s/player/`), and connectivity probes so video playback never breaks or stalls.
-  3. **HLS Stream Cleanser**: Intercepts `.m3u8` playlists and strips `#EXT-X-CUE-OUT` / SCTE-35 ad break markers in real-time.
-  4. **DOM Ad-Skipper & Cosmetic Filter**: Automatically dismisses overlays, fast-forwards in-stream ads, and injects cosmetic CSS hide rules.
-- 🖥️ **Smart TV User-Agent**: Configured with a Smart TV User-Agent string to automatically load optimized 10-foot TV interfaces.
-- 🎮 **Hardware Remote Integration**: Handles media keys (Play/Pause) and back navigation gracefully.
+- 🛋️ **TV-first**: Leanback launcher banner and D-pad remote navigation.
+- ⚡ **Native ad-block engine**: Rust JNI bindings to `adblock-rust` with fast rule matching for EasyList, uBlock Origin and Brave lists.
+- 🛡️ **Layered ad blocking**:
+  1. **Network layer**: blocks ad networks, telemetry and trackers before requests leave the device, plus YouTube's own ad endpoints.
+  2. **Ad data pruning**: a script injected at document start (`assets/yt_adblock.js`) removes ad fields (`adPlacements`, `playerAds`, `adSlots`) from YouTube's player responses, so the player has no ads to play.
+  3. **Player fallback**: mutes and skips ads that still reach the player, and clicks skip buttons.
+  4. **Stream allowlist**: protects video CDN streams (`googlevideo.com`) and player scripts so playback doesn't break.
+  5. **HLS cleaner**: strips `#EXT-X-CUE-OUT` / SCTE-35 ad markers from `.m3u8` playlists on other sites.
+  6. **Cosmetic filtering**: hides leftover ad elements with CSS.
+- 🖥️ **Smart TV user agent** so sites load their 10-foot TV interfaces.
+- 🎮 **Remote support**: media keys (play/pause) and back navigation.
+- 📦 **Prebuilt native libraries** for `armeabi-v7a`, `arm64-v8a`, `x86` and `x86_64`.
 
